*** oswego.pgm — Epi Info 7 Classic Analysis program (Epiora v0.2 Task 3)
*** READ the Oswego data table (Oswego12, 75 rows) in the Sample.mdb bundled
*** with the official Epi Info 7.2.7.0 release ZIP — .prj view READs are not
*** possible from CI binaries because the shipped .prj connection strings
*** fail to decrypt (docs/spikes/ei7-windows.md) — then FREQ SEX,
*** TABLES VANILLA ILL and TABLES VANILLA ILL STRATAVAR=SEX (spec §6.4),
*** routed to a single HTML file, then QUIT so Analysis.exe exits on its own
*** (required for headless CI use). run.ps1 substitutes @SAMPLE_MDB@ and
*** @OUTPUT_HTML@ with absolute forward-slash paths and saves the result as
*** *.pgm7 — Analysis.exe only honours arguments containing ".pgm7".
READ '@SAMPLE_MDB@':Oswego12
ROUTEOUT "@OUTPUT_HTML@" REPLACE
FREQ SEX
TABLES VANILLA ILL
TABLES VANILLA ILL STRATAVAR=SEX
CLOSEOUT
QUIT
